 Types of commands:
 
 1. Internal command
 2. External command
 
 
 Internal command:
  Commands which are built in linux OS
  ex: pwd, mkdir, cd..etc
  
 External command:
 Commands which should be installed or added to a linux environment
  Ex: tree
  
 How to install the external command?
 
 Sudo apt-get install <commad-name>
 
 ex: sudo apt-get install tree
 
 Sudo: super user do / root user (admin permissions)
 
